# ── Personal finance dashboard ──────────────────────────────────
# Raw statements, balances, mortgage terms, generated cleartext payload.
# NOTHING in here is ever committed. Only the AES-encrypted blob in
# public/finances/data.enc.json goes to the public repo.
finance-private/

# The encrypted payload is generated locally by `npm run finance` and committed
# deliberately (see tools/finance/README.md). It is force-added rather than
# tracked automatically, so a stale or test-encrypted blob can never slip in.
public/finances/data.enc.json
